Description: Python client library for the IPEX B2B REST API
 Provides a client for the IPEX B2B REST API (restapi.ipex.cz): token
 handling with automatic refresh and one method for every API operation
 (customers, services, VoIP and mobile numbers, calls, invoices, PBX,
 connectors, reports, ...). Python counterpart of php-spojenet-ipex-b2b.
